# needs a refresh: changed scripts/hooks/skills, updated Fork Maintenance prose, or a
# data migration added to install.sh's run_migrations(). install.sh writes this into the
# fork on every install; audit.sh surfaces it; `install.sh --check` compares it to the
# kit's, and `install.sh --update` refreshes a fork to it. Comments here are ignored.
